<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;color:#183e30;">Das Passwort eines Benutzers wurde geändert.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 18px;color:#425850;">Das neue Passwort wird aus Sicherheitsgründen nicht gespeichert und nicht per E-Mail verschickt.</p>

<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;margin:0 0 22px;border:1px solid #dbe8e2;border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;">
    <tr>
        <td style="padding:10px 12px;background:#f3f7f4;color:#5f746b;font-size:13px;width:38%;">Benutzer</td>
        <td style="padding:10px 12px;color:#183e30;font-size:14px;"><strong>{{user_login}}</strong></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td style="padding:10px 12px;background:#f3f7f4;color:#5f746b;font-size:13px;">Name</td>
        <td style="padding:10px 12px;color:#183e30;font-size:14px;">{{user_display_name}}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td style="padding:10px 12px;background:#f3f7f4;color:#5f746b;font-size:13px;">E-Mail</td>
        <td style="padding:10px 12px;color:#183e30;font-size:14px;">{{user_email}}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td style="padding:10px 12px;background:#f3f7f4;color:#5f746b;font-size:13px;">Zeitpunkt</td>
        <td style="padding:10px 12px;color:#183e30;font-size:14px;">{{changed_at}}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td style="padding:10px 12px;background:#f3f7f4;color:#5f746b;font-size:13px;">Auslöser</td>
        <td style="padding:10px 12px;color:#183e30;font-size:14px;">{{password_change_source}}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td style="padding:10px 12px;background:#f3f7f4;color:#5f746b;font-size:13px;">Geändert durch</td>
        <td style="padding:10px 12px;color:#183e30;font-size:14px;">{{changed_by}}</td>
    </tr>
</table>

<p style="margin:24px 0 0;"><a href="{{admin_user_url}}" style="display:inline-block;background:#008f6b;color:#ffffff;padding:12px 18px;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold;">Nutzer prüfen</a></p>
